    <summary>Private workout tracking in your Nextcloud</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
KraftLog tracks strength workouts, running and bouldering sessions, reusable
routines, exercises, progress and body weight. Every user's data is kept
separate in the Nextcloud database.
    ]]></description>
